    m_Localized: FIND KAMP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324726
    m_Localized: "\xC5BEN FOR ALLE \xB7 STARTER OM {0}"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324727
    m_Localized: "Ingen \xE5bne kampe lige nu. Din lobby er \xE5ben for alle."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324728
    m_Localized: "Ingen \xE5bne kampe lige nu."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324729
    m_Localized: "Find en kamp, f\xF8r andre slutter sig til din lobby."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324730
    m_Localized: Den kamp er fuld.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324731
    m_Localized: "Den kamp er allerede g\xE5et i gang."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324732
    m_Localized: Det spil er ikke Dead on Arrival.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324733
    m_Localized: Den lobby er ikke en Dead on Arrival-kamp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324734
    m_Localized: "G\xF8r din kamp f\xE6rdig, f\xF8r du slutter dig til en vens."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324735
    m_Localized: "Forlad din onlinekamp, f\xF8r du slutter dig til en anden."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324736
    m_Localized: "Den kamp k\xF8rer version {0}, og du har {1}. I skal have samme
      version."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324737
    m_Localized: en ukendt version
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324738
    m_Localized: "Den kamp k\xF8rer et andet build af version {0}. I skal have samme
      build."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324739
    m_Localized: Start Steam for at spille online.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324740
    m_Localized: "Steam kunne ikke \xE5bne en lobby. Pr\xF8v igen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324741
    m_Localized: "Onlinekampen kunne ikke starte. Pr\xF8v igen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324742
    m_Localized: "Kunne ikke deltage i kampen. Den er m\xE5ske slut."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324743
    m_Localized: Inviter venner fra din Steam-venneliste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324744
    m_Localized: 'Afbrudt: for mange beskeder.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324745
    m_Localized: Taget ud af revanchen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324746
    m_Localized: "V\xE6rten forlod kampen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324747
    m_Localized: "Kunne ikke n\xE5 v\xE6rten."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324748
    m_Localized: Forbindelsen blev afbrudt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324749
    m_Localized: 'Y / Trekant: spil online med Steam-venner'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324750
    m_Localized: 'Y / Trekant: inviter venner      B / Cirkel: forlad'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324751
    m_Localized: 'B / Cirkel: forlad online'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324752
    m_Localized: Spiller {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324753
    m_Localized: Tilslut en controller for at spille
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324754
    m_Localized: "Tryk p\xE5 mellemrum for at spille med tastatur, eller tilslut
      en controller"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324755
    m_Localized: "Den controller underst\xF8ttes ikke - pr\xF8v en Xbox-, PlayStation-
      eller Switch Pro-controller"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 11191324756
    m_Localized: "S{0}s controller er afbrudt\nTryk p\xE5 en knap p\xE5 en vilk\xE5rlig
      controller for at forts\xE6tte"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
